        <mxCell id="AclGt35vSFEsw-cFP4Dt-37" value="&lt;table&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td data-end=&quot;819&quot; data-start=&quot;798&quot; class=&quot;max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;811&quot; data-start=&quot;800&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td data-end=&quot;1005&quot; data-start=&quot;819&quot; class=&quot;max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)/2)]&quot;&gt;Indicates formal agreement with the proposed contribution. &lt;br&gt;• A minimum of &lt;strong data-end=&quot;912&quot; data-start=&quot;899&quot;&gt;three (3)&lt;/strong&gt; Working Group members must submit “Approve” reviews for the PR to be eligible for merging.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="AclGt35vSFEsw-cFP4Dt-35">
