        <mxCell id="KTR_t2K-DAFD93J0yK-D-5" value="&lt;table&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td data-end=&quot;545&quot; data-start=&quot;524&quot; class=&quot;max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)]&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-end=&quot;537&quot; data-start=&quot;526&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;table&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td data-end=&quot;797&quot; data-start=&quot;545&quot; class=&quot;max-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)*2/3)] min-w-[calc(var(--thread-content-max-width)/2)]&quot;&gt;Used to provide non-blocking feedback, such as suggestions, clarifications, or minor edits. &lt;br&gt;• All comments &lt;strong data-end=&quot;666&quot; data-start=&quot;658&quot;&gt;MUST&lt;/strong&gt; be considered by the Working Group. &lt;br&gt;• They &lt;strong data-end=&quot;721&quot; data-start=&quot;714&quot;&gt;MAY&lt;/strong&gt; be dismissed if deemed non-impactful, already addressed, or out of scope.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="KTR_t2K-DAFD93J0yK-D-4">
